    "Five AMP prediction models (Macrel, AmPEP, AMP Scanner V2, AMPlify_bal, AMPlify_imbal) were used to validate LLM-generated encrypted AMPs in 2025 paper (doi:10.1128/spectrum.01504-25, Fig 1i).",
